# --proxy-headers + --forwarded-allow-ips="*" make uvicorn trust the
# X-Forwarded-For that Render's load balancer sets. Without them
# request.client.host is the balancer's own address for every request, so
# slowapi's get_remote_address returns one shared key and all users compete for
# a single rate-limit bucket - the login limiter in particular would lock out
# everyone once any one person tripped it.
#
# Trusting "*" is safe only because nothing but Render's proxy can reach this
# process; do not copy this flag onto a directly exposed port.
web: uvicorn main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port $PORT --proxy-headers --forwarded-allow-ips="*"
